{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ATTENTION: This is a hardcore game where awareness and independent decision-making are essential.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You choose what to research and how to progress. There\u2019s no single \u201ccorrect\u201d path\u2014experiment, try different strategies, learn from mistakes, and develop your own tactics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grim strategy game that combines base building, defending against enemy waves, and exploring a star map filled with missions, events, and traders.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/e76c843fd1a7030fbb344eb64305bfe3.poster.avif?t=1772629821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/e76c843fd1a7030fbb344eb64305bfe3.webm?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/e76c843fd1a7030fbb344eb64305bfe3.mp4?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the last interstellar ship under the control of artificial intelligence, sending robots to restore destroyed planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a series of environmental disasters and the collapse of human civilization, you are the only remaining AI, drifting in space with the surviving drones. Communication with the &quot;creators&quot; is lost. Systems are on the verge of failure. But the mission is not over yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new worlds, make decisions, build and fight - all for the last chance to right the wrongs of the past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/6283ad58cc10bf00c63b64d5d43c8d70.poster.avif?t=1772629821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/6283ad58cc10bf00c63b64d5d43c8d70.webm?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/6283ad58cc10bf00c63b64d5d43c8d70.mp4?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star map: each run is a unique route with different missions, events and traders.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time strategy: build a base, place turrets and defenses, manage resources and plan your actions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark post-apocalyptic world: the landscape dynamically changes due to the interaction of tiles. Your actions affect the ecological state of each planet.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive structures: build a variety of turrets - from simple ballistas to powerful cannons - and watch them destroy enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous progress: collect shards, unlock new robots, skills and containers to move further into the galaxy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.poster.avif?t=1772629821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.webm?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.mp4?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Prepare for an intense strategic struggle for survival and restoration of the world, where every move you make can be decisive!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.poster.avif?t=1772629821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.webm?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.mp4?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3277010/45677d2e0c2ef26ede282f4d32ba835470189059.jpg"},{"name":"2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3277010/ae442b5ece32ae152eae4aafc3a6b9f1a8da9e97.jpg"},{"name":"3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3277010/0c93b42b818d57a4e8e05f50ad2caa70bc066630.jpg"},{"name":"4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3277010/da326a5cb0eabb9c40355259e5b262f23a164887.jpg"},{"name":"5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3277010/ace35f872fa770912b939f34cdee6a4666d41310.jpg"},{"name":"6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3277010/49b99421cd7c205e617e826f0402b81cedba5685.jpg"},{"name":"7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3277010/241a9b62a7a97c6ee56a92744efa7b42d91c8aa7.jpg"},{"name":"8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3277010/f9a42fdd049033ad30704d349e65092cf6723dda.jpg"},{"name":"9","path":"https: