tegy: build a base, place turrets and defenses, manage resources and plan your actions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark post-apocalyptic world: the landscape dynamically changes due to the interaction of tiles. Your actions affect the ecological state of each planet.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive structures: build a variety of turrets - from simple ballistas to powerful cannons - and watch them destroy enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous progress: collect shards, unlock new robots, skills and containers to move further into the galaxy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.poster.avif?t=1772629821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.webm?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.mp4?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Prepare for an intense strategic struggle for survival and restoration of the world, where every move you make can be decisive!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.poster.avif?t=1772629821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.webm?t=1772629821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/